{"type":"text","timestamp":1792775744079,"sessionID":"ses_e963d4f1dffeT4MdaSGuvKFd6l","part":{"id":"prt_169c2e666001s2Ra1ZX6R3FrIQ","messageID":"msg_169c2d9c6001ayIR5B1k0oDG3N","sessionID":"ses_e963d4f1dffeT4MdaSGuvKFd6l","type":"text","text":"The scientific consensus is that there is no link between the MMR vaccine and autism. Multiple large-scale studies, meta-analyses, and reviews by organizations like the CDC, WHO, and the Lancet have consistently found no evidence of such a connection. The original 1998 study claiming a link was retracted due to ethical violations and flawed methodology. For the latest guidance, consult peer-reviewed research or official health organization statements.","time":{"start":1792775743078,"end":1792775744068}}}
